# Sensitive / lab-specific — never commit (generated as-built docs, lab dumps)
*.docx
*.dotx
# ...except the bundled HPE as-built template (a shipped app resource)
!Provisioning_Automation/alletra_onboard/src/alletra_onboard/resources/asbuilt_template.docx
docx_images/
*.csv
*.json
*.env
.env.*

# Raw research scratch files
*.txt
# ...except captured device output kept deliberately as TEST FIXTURES. These are checked for
# credentials and IPs before committing (the blanket rule above exists because lab dumps leak —
# see docs/LESSONS.md 21). Nothing here may contain an address, a password or a hostname of a
# machine outside the lab.
!Provisioning_Automation/alletra_onboard/tests/fixtures/**/*.txt
*.html
*.yaml
*.pdf
*.db

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.bak

# Claude internal
.claude/

# UI capture output (console screenshots/HTML — may contain sensitive UI)
.alletra_onboard/

# Committed templates (no secrets) — exceptions to the broad ignores above
!**/config/arrays.example.csv
# Design mockups: hand-authored, reviewed, and sanitised (documentation-range IPs only)
!Provisioning_Automation/alletra_onboard/docs/ux/*.html
